  <string key="license.components.body">
    <en>Spicetify CLI: LGPL-2.1. Spicetify Marketplace: MIT. Full notices are included. Use --export-source &lt;folder&gt; to export third-party source and licenses (downloaded on demand in the standard installer; embedded offline). Project source is a separate Release ZIP. This is an independent derivative project, not an official Spotify product.</en>
    <zh>Spicetify CLI：LGPL-2.1。Spicetify Marketplace：MIT。完整许可已包含，可用 --export-source &lt;目录&gt; 导出第三方源码及许可（标准版按需下载，离线版内置）；项目源码以独立 Release ZIP 提供。本项目为独立维护的衍生项目，并非 Spotify 官方产品。</zh>
  </string>
