  <string key="guide.install.title" target="GuideInstallTitle" property="Text">
    <en>01   Install, then open Spotify</en>
    <zh>01   安装后打开 Spotify</zh>
  </string>
  <string key="guide.install.body" target="GuideInstallBody" property="Text">
    <en>Choose Install / Repair after closing Spotify, including its tray icon. Both standard and administrator sessions are supported.</en>
    <zh>退出 Spotify（包括托盘图标）后，选择“安装 / 修复”。普通权限和管理员权限均支持。</zh>
  </string>
  <string key="guide.lyrics.title" target="GuideLyricsTitle" property="Text">
    <en>02   Your lyrics, one click away</en>
    <zh>02   一键打开桌面歌词</zh>
  </string>
  <string key="guide.lyrics.body" target="GuideLyricsBody" property="Text">
    <en>Use the A button to the left of Spotify's microphone. Hover over the lyrics for timing, type, opacity and color controls. Drag to move; resize from the edge.</en>
    <zh>点击 Spotify 麦克风左侧的 A 按钮。鼠标移到歌词上方可调节校时、字体、透明度和颜色；拖动以移动，从边缘调整大小。</zh>
  </string>
  <string key="guide.session.title" target="GuideSessionTitle" property="Text">
    <en>03   Built into your Spotify session</en>
    <zh>03   随 Spotify 一起运行</zh>
  </string>
  <string key="guide.session.body" target="GuideSessionBody" property="Text">
    <en>Spotify Lyrics starts and exits with Spotify. LRCLIB → QQ Music → NetEase fallback. Run Install / Repair again if a Spotify update removes the integration.</en>
    <zh>Spotify Lyrics 随 Spotify 启动和退出。歌词按 LRCLIB → QQ 音乐 → 网易云音乐依次查找。Spotify 更新后若集成失效，请重新运行“安装 / 修复”。</zh>
  </string>
